# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local reference folders (NOT synced to GitHub)
# These hold infographics, decks, narration, customer packs, and utility
# scripts that are preserved locally but excluded from the repository.
# Use anchored patterns (/learn/ and /temp/) so they only match root-level
# directories and do NOT catch docs/learning/Learn/ (case-insensitive safe).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/learn/
/temp/

